+        // full txid AND the REAL (big-endian-decoded) txix. These were recorded
+        // pre-#10 as 512/1024/512/256 — the LE-mis-keyed values (BE 2/4/2/1);
+        // after the TxIx BE fix they resolve to their real indices.
+        (
+            "dca0e8d51c6453bb16d303e5e3a3a2eede8a7cdf5c63bd4e52bfe1f9575fcdd4",
+            2,
+            "7afbde082796cfa6ed6ba87728c57f111815340af03e1897094163b3",
